Thepaddingproperty 
is used to add some space inside the text field.

Tip:When you have several input fields after each other, you might 
also want to add somemargin, to add more space 
around them:

Theborderproperty 
is used to change the border size and color, and 
theborder-radiusproperty 
can be used to add rounded corners:

If you only want a bottom border, use theborder-bottomproperty:

Thebackground-colorproperty 
is used to add a background color to the input, and 
thecolorproperty 
is used to change the text color:

### Code Snippets

```
input
{
width: 100%;
}

---

input[type=text]
{
width: 100%;
padding: 12px;
margin: 10px 0;
box-sizing: border-box;
}

---

input[type=text]
{
border: 2px solid red;
border-radius: 8px;
}

---

input[type=text]
{
border: none;
border-bottom: 1px solid red;
}

---

input[type=text]
{
background-color: #3CBC8D;
color: white;
}
```
